{"file": "evals/results/it29-r14/haiku/full-C1/S6.md", "sid": "S6", "verdict": {"meaning_changed": true, "issues": ["The second confirmation note's reading (2) adds a claim the original does not contain: that QA staff follow a different standard, which contradicts the original's statement that QA staff must also notify.", "The second note misstates the real ambiguity, which is whether 관리자 권한이 있는 applies only to 팀원 or also to QA 담당자, so neither listed reading covers the case where only QA staff with admin rights must notify."]}}
